! Yaman.ascl
!
Yaman in C# - Nadi (just intonation). Romantic and serene; tivra Ma is the signature. Lydian in feel.
!
 7
!
 9/8
 5/4
 45/32
 3/2
 5/3
 15/8
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   Re    203.91 cents
!   Ga    386.31 cents
!   Ma+   590.22 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   Dha   884.36 cents
!   Ni   1088.27 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
! Sattvagenic - sattvagenic.com/nadi
!
! @ABL NOTE_NAMES "Sa" "Re" "Ga" "Ma+" "Pa" "Dha" "Ni"
! @ABL REFERENCE_PITCH 3 0 277.182631
! @ABL SOURCE sattvagenic.com/nadi
